PentaX modifications, 2026-10-18:
  Adapted the above portions into safe Rust with immutable owned source,
  owner-bound graph views, a private typed IR, finite capacity/work/ID/record
  limits, fallible arena reservation, iterative graph/SSA traversal, typed
  errors instead of process aborts, and original synthetic regression tests.
  Restricted stage/resource/modifier forms to the implemented lowerings and
  added explicit refusals for source paths not ported. Replaced source
  uninitialized-register zero substitution with an explicit reject/OpUndef
  policy. Kept the source NativeBinding and shader-data numbering, exposed
  typed caller specialization and a read-only output/host-feature manifest,
  and added independent official-tool validation of original output modules.

